# a read of the slot as a value makes the closure and lays it in the slot. Where such a read stands in a loop the look counts that store, and what the state holds of the slot ends at the head, as with any store in a loop: the call in the loop goes by the read beside it. The twin with the call alone in the loop is call-off-the-literal-that-the-unit-made-reads-neither-slot-nor-capture.ir.
